        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_INSOLVENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Your income has been at or below 0 for five turns or more. Emergency loans only cover a short spell; cut upkeep or raise Gold.</Text></Replace>
