        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_EMERGENCY" Language="es_ES"><Text>Emergency loan</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPAY_ALL" Language="es_ES"><Text>Repay all next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPAY_HALF" Language="es_ES"><Text>Repay half next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_RESTRUCTURE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Restructure</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPUDIATE_LENDER" Language="es_ES"><Text>Repudiate what you owe {1_Lender}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RESTRUCTURE_PREVIEW" Language="es_ES"><Text>What's left, {1_Owed} Gold, spreads over 10 new turns at the current {2_Rate}: about {3_Payment} Gold a turn. Your standing takes one more miss, and this loan can't be restructured again.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REPUDIATE_PREVIEW" Language="es_ES"><Text>You keep {1_Kept} Gold and stop paying. {2_Lender} books a grudge of {3_Grudge} grievances against you; {4_Count} civilizations you've met each move {5_Delta} in relationship; your standing falls to {6_Standing}; {7_Lender} closes to you for {8_For}; your credit limit loses {9_Turns} turns of income and terms stay at 10 turns for 40 turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REPUDIATE_AT_WAR" Language="es_ES"><Text>You're at war with this lender, so the world expects it: the witness and standing costs are halved.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_CLOSED_TURNS" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Turns} turns</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_CLOSED_AGES" Language="es_ES"><Text>the rest of this age and the whole of the next</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_LENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>What you've lent</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LENT_ROW" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Loan}: {2_Owed} Gold owed to you by {3_Borrower} at {4_Rate} a turn, {5_Turns} payments left</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_ALLOW_RESTRUCTURE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Let them restructure</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND" Language="es_ES"><Text>Lend</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_NOBODY" Language="es_ES"><Text>There's no civilization to lend to.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_BOND_RATE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Their bond rate is {1_Rate}; they accept up to 1.2 times it</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_RISK" Language="es_ES"><Text>Repudiation risk: {1_Text}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_RULE" Language="es_ES"><Text>They accept while they're short of Gold, their income is positive and the payments fit their limits. If they default or repudiate, the loss is yours.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_LOW" Language="es_ES"><Text>low. They repudiate a debt to an enemy at war, or to a civilization they dislike while insolvent or in default.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_WAR" Language="es_ES"><Text>high: you're at war with them, and they repudiate debts to enemies.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_INSOLVENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>they've had no income for {1_Turns} turns; they can't take your loan and may repudiate what they owe.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_NO_INCOME" Language="es_ES"><Text>their income is at or below 0, so they won't accept.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_DEFAULT" Language="es_ES"><Text>they're in default on another loan.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_UNFRIENDLY" Language="es_ES"><Text>they dislike you: a debt over {1_Amount} Gold is one they'd repudiate while in trouble.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD" Language="es_ES"><Text>Auto-loan guard</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_STATE" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard is</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_ALLOWANCE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Emergency allowance left</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_SWITCH_ON" Language="es_ES"><Text>Switch the guard on</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_SWITCH_OFF" Language="es_ES"><Text>Switch the guard off</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_NOTE" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard borrows for you when your balance would go below 0 while your income is at or below 0, which is when the game disbands units. A dip with positive income costs nothing, so it leaves that alone.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING" Language="es_ES"><Text>Queued for next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING_NONE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Nothing queued.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING_NOTE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Requests run at the start of the next turn, in this order. The turn's notice says what was refused and why.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CARDS" Language="es_ES"><Text>Tax cards</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_TAXES_OFF" Language="es_ES"><Text>The Taxes option is off for this game, so there are no tax cards.</Text></Replace>
