        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_FORECAST_ROW" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Gold} Gold and {2_Happiness} Happiness a turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_LEVY_PEACE" Language="es_ES"><Text>nothing until you're at war</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_SLOT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Slot this card</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CLEAR" Language="es_ES"><Text>Clear the tax card</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_NO_SWAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>The game isn't allowing a policy change right now.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_NOTE" Language="es_ES"><Text>These are ordinary policy cards: the policy menu shows them too, and the computer players pick them the way they pick any card.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_SENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Done. The card is in your slot.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_CLEARED" Language="es_ES"><Text>Done. The slot is free.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_NO_SWAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>The game refused the change.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_NO_SLOT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Every policy slot is full. Free one in the policy menu first.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_UNKNOWN" Language="es_ES"><Text>That card isn't in this age.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_VERDICT_SAME" Language="es_ES"><Text>That card is already slotted.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTIFY_TITLE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Economics</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTIFY_FALLBACK" Language="es_ES"><Text>Your treasury moved this turn. Open the Economics screen for the details.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_NET" Language="es_ES"><Text>Loans moved your treasury by {1_Amount} Gold.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_INFLUENCE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Missed payments cost you {1_Amount} Influence.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_CELEBRATION" Language="es_ES"><Text>Taxes moved your celebration meter by {1_Amount}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_OPEN" Language="es_ES"><Text>A loan of {1_Amount} Gold from {2_Lender} has landed, at {3_Rate} a turn over {4_Turns} turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_LENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Your loan of {1_Amount} Gold to {2_Borrower} has gone out.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_MISS" Language="es_ES"><Text>You missed a payment on loan {1_Loan} ({2_Count} in a row). The interest joins the debt and the rate rises; three in a row is default.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_DEFAULT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Loan {1_Loan} is in default. The lender takes what it can each turn and won't lend to you again this age.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_DEFAULTED_ON" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Borrower} has defaulted on your loan {2_Loan}. You collect what you can each turn.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_GUARD" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard borrowed {1_Amount} Gold from {2_Lender} to keep you above 0.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_GUARD_INSOLVENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard borrowed {1_Amount} Gold from {2_Lender}. Your income has been at or below 0 for five turns: this covers a spell, not a deficit.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_GUARD_CAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard has reached its cap of {1_Cap} Gold and stops. You're {2_Deficit} Gold short this turn; the game's own penalties now apply below 0 Gold, and units disband below {3_Line}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_INSOLVENT" Language="es_ES"><Text>Your income has been at or below 0 for {1_Turns} turns. Emergency loans cover a short spell only; cut upkeep or raise Gold.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_RESTRUCTURE" Language="es_ES"><Text>Loan {1_Loan} was restructured over 10 new turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_RESTRUCTURE_ASK" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Borrower} asks to restructure loan {2_Loan}. You can allow it on the Loans tab.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_REPUDIATED" Language="es_ES"><Text>You repudiated {1_Amount} Gold owed to {2_Lender}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_REPUDIATED_BY" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Borrower} repudiated {2_Amount} Gold it owed you. Its grievance against you is booked, and the civilizations it has met think less of it.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_NOTICE_REFUSED" Language="es_ES"><Text>Your {1_Request} was refused: {2_Reason}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_BORROW" Language="es_ES"><Text>borrow request</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_LEND" Language="es_ES"><Text>loan offer</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_REPAY" Language="es_ES"><Text>early repayment</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_RESTRUCTURE" Language="es_ES"><Text>restructure request</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_REPUDIATE" Language="es_ES"><Text>repudiation</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_TAX" Language="es_ES"><Text>tax change</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REQUEST_UNKNOWN" Language="es_ES"><Text>request</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_CREDIT_CAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>it's over your credit limit.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_SERVICE_CAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>the payments would take more than 35 percent of your income.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TERMS" Language="es_ES"><Text>the amount or term isn't one the lender takes.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_LOAN_LIMIT" Language="es_ES"><Text>six loans are open already.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_LENDER" Language="es_ES"><Text>that lender is gone.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_BORROWER" Language="es_ES"><Text>that borrower is gone.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_NO_OFFER" Language="es_ES"><Text>the lender won't lend to you right now.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TERM_STAGE" Language="es_ES"><Text>terms beyond 10 turns need Public debt.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TERM_BANKING" Language="es_ES"><Text>a civilization lends beyond 10 turns only with a bank.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TERM_REPUDIATION" Language="es_ES"><Text>while a repudiation counts against you, terms stay at 10 turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_PARTIES" Language="es_ES"><Text>that isn't something you can ask of them.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_AI_OFF" Language="es_ES"><Text>the computer players aren't borrowing or lending in this game.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_BALANCE" Language="es_ES"><Text>you don't hold that much Gold.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_DECLINED" Language="es_ES"><Text>they declined: the rate is too high, they aren't short, or the payments don't fit their limits.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_NOT_OVERDUE" Language="es_ES"><Text>only an overdue loan can be restructured, and only once.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_INCOME" Language="es_ES"><Text>a civilization with income at or below 0 can't restructure.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_NOTHING_OWED" Language="es_ES"><Text>nothing is owed to that lender.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TAXES_NATIVE" Language="es_ES"><Text>taxes are policy cards in this game; use the Fiscal tab.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_TOO_SOON" Language="es_ES"><Text>the tax level changed in the last five turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REASON_UNKNOWN" Language="es_ES"><Text>the request couldn't be carried out.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_OPEN" Language="es_ES"><Text>Loan {1_Loan} opened: {2_Amount} Gold from {3_Lender} to {4_Borrower}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_MISS" Language="es_ES"><Text>Payment missed on {1_Loan} ({2_Count} in a row).</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_DEFAULT" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Loan} went into default ({2_Borrower}).</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_CLOSED" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Loan} paid off.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_RESTRUCTURE" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Loan} restructured with {2_Amount} Gold left.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_REPUDIATION" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Borrower} repudiated {2_Amount} Gold owed to {3_Lender} ({4_Grudge} grievances).</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_WRITEOFF" Language="es_ES"><Text>{1_Loan} written off: {2_Amount} Gold, a party is gone.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_GUARD" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard borrowed {1_Amount} Gold from {2_Lender}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_EVENT_GUARD_CAP" Language="es_ES"><Text>The guard stopped at its cap of {1_Cap} Gold.</Text></Replace>
